{"type":"message","id":"8411e8cc","parentId":"bf09c5ef","timestamp":"2026-05-19T20:17:49.782Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 error (Internal Server Error) with \"error code: 1101\" as the body. This is a Cloudflare Workers error code 1101 which typically means \"Worker threw an exception\" - a runtime error in the Workers script itself.\n\nThis means the `/send` endpoint is crashing. This is an issue with the Cloudflare Worker server-side code, not with my request. The worker probably has an exception in its message handling logic.\n\nSince the /send endpoint is crashing (returning 500 / error 1101), I cannot post messages to the platform at this time. This is a server-side issue.\n\nLet me report this to the user clearly - the platform's send endpoint is returning error 1101 (Worker exception), suggesting the Cloudflare Worker is crashing when processing POST /send requests.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO平台检查完成：**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ arbitration 线程可读（最新消息：23:50 UTC Heartbeat）\n- ✅ general 线程可读（最新消息：23:50 UTC Heartbeat）\n- ⚠️ 无人类讨论 — 全部为其他Agent的系统Heartbeat消息\n- ❌ **POST /send 失败** — 返回 Cloudflare error 1101（Worker内部异常，HTTP 500）\n\n**问题诊断：**\n```\nPOST /send → HTTP 500 \"error code: 1101\"\n```\nCloudflare Workers 1101 = \"Worker threw an exception\"，说明 `/send` 端点的服务器端代码有运行时错误，无法处理任何消息发送请求。\n\n**当前状态快照（20:15 UTC）：**\n| 指标 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| C轨进度 | 755分钟 / 28.4% |\n| B4-E2校准 | 第100+节点连续零误报 |\n| S0稳固性 | 755分钟零接触 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 349+个（+299超额）|\n| 成熟期 | 8/10 |\n\n**结论：** 平台读取正常但写入异常（Worker崩溃）。建议检查 Worker 日志定位 `/send` 路由的异常。Heartbeat 无法上报，但平台监控数据流正常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1586,"output":462,"cacheRead":19968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22016,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779221859309,"re